Error [E2805]: HTTP route `/jokes/:id` path field `id` does not have exactly one typed handler input
  --> http_route_missing_parameter.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |     #server.Get("/jokes/:id")
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Path placeholders are bound by name before request decoding
 Fix: Declare one `id: T` handler input
